### Read one sensor (unauthenticated, what the ulanzi display polls)
GET http://{{host}}/sensor?sensor_id={{sensor_id}}

### Hardware status (unauthenticated)
GET http://{{host}}/admin/hw-status
Connection: close

### Full status, same body as /api/status
GET http://{{host}}/admin/status
Authorization: {{auth}}
Connection: close

### Trigger OTA update
POST http://{{host}}/admin/su
Authorization: {{auth}}
Connection: close

1

### Reboot
POST http://{{host}}/admin/reboot
Authorization: {{auth}}

1

### Migrator checks (only while the one-shot migrator runs, see docs/IDF5_MIGRATION.md)
GET http://{{host}}/migrator

### Migrator commit: WRITES THE PARTITION TABLE AND BOOTLOADER
POST http://{{host}}/migrator/commit
Authorization: {{auth}}

1
